      "description": "Головна дія відкриття звернення.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\" type=\"button\">Zapytaj o sesję 1:1</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:22px;min-height:50px;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 24px;font:600 16px/1.3 Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .17s ease,color .17s ease;background:var(--olive,#514a08);color:var(--paper,#fefffa);}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:var(--olive-hover,#3f3906);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--olive,#514a08);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-button-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px);}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.7;cursor:wait;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Світла кнопка зі стрілкою",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-light",
      "description": "Світла дія поверх фотографії.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-light\" type=\"button\">Umów sesję 1:1<span class=\"ds-button-arrow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-light{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:22px;min-height:50px;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 24px;font:600 16px/1.3 Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .17s ease,color .17s ease;background:var(--paper,#fefffa);color:var(--ink,#171504);}.ds-button-light:hover{background:var(--straw,#ede8cc);}.ds-button-light:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--olive,#514a08);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-button-light:active{transform:translateY(1px);}.ds-button-arrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:34px;height:34px;margin-right:-10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--olive,#514a08);color:var(--paper,#fefffa);}.ds-button-arrow svg{width:19px;height:19px;}"
    },
    {
